   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"6\">\n  <li>The function <span data-math=\"v\">v</span> is defined by <span data-math=\"v(x)=12(x+5)^2−7\">v(x)=12(x+5)^2−7</span>.\n<p>Without graphing, determine if the vertex of the graph representing <span data-math=\"v\">v</span> shows the minimum or maximum value of the function.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1278521,
     "content_html": "The vertex shows the minimum value."
    },
    {
     "id": 1278522,
     "content_html": "The vertex shows the maximum value."
    }
